{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"mineshaft_t2","model_identifier":"mineshaft_t2","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# mineshaft_t2\n\nMineshaft tier 2: a taller squared-timber head-frame with a sheave wheel, a horse-gin style winding drum in a shed, and an ore bin.\n\n- Footprint: 8 x 7 columns (128 x 112 units, 3.60 x 3.15 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -56..80, y 0..101, z -24..50 units.\n- Texture: 256 x 256, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 36, construction_0 22, construction_33 33, construction_66 41, ruined 12 (7 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- head-frame: 32 x 100 x 32 centred at the origin\n- winder shed: 52 x 62 x 52 at x 52, z 4\n- ore bin: 32 x 25 x 32 at x -40, z -8\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `mineshaft_t2_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `mineshaft_t2_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_mineshaft_t2` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `working` | 3.0 | loop | `sheave` turns once per 3 s. Winding `drum` turns with it. |\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, -24)\n- `slot_dropoff` at (-40, 0, -32)\n"},"resolution":{"width":256,"height":256},"elements":[{"name":"collar","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-18.0,0.0,-18.0],"to":[18.0,4.0,18.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[212.0,158.0,248.0,162.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[212.0,158.0,248.0,162.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[212.0,158.0,248.0,162.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[212.0,158.0,248.0,162.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[38.0,0.0,74.0,36.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[38.0,0.0,74.0,36.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"bb5a1603-407a-5b36-abd0-2dbf3c01950d"},{"name":"shaft","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-14.0,0.0,-14.0],"to":[14.0,4.2,14.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[100.0,158.8,128.0,163.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[100.0,158.8,128.0,163.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[100.0,158.8,128.0,163.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[100.0,158.8,128.0,163.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[88.0,96.0,116.0,124.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[88.0,96.0,116.0,124.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"89fe44ba-6718-5f0c-be6c-52daae9caad8"},{"name":"hf_leg0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-16.0,4.0,-16.0],"to":[-12.0,84.0,-12.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[14.0,0.0,18.0,80.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[14.0,0.0,18.0,80.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[14.0,0.0,18.0,80.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[14.0,0.0,18.0,80.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[178.0